Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:02.23,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:04.98,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.61,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}You've been working so much \Novertime lately. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.36,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:17.20,Default,Child Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Momma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.60,Default,Child Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Momma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:22.86,Default,Akane's Mom,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right. Momma's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.55,Default,Akane's Mom,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here, let me wipe you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:26.38,Default,Akane's Mom,0,0,0,,{\i1}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:28.76,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Yay!{orig: Banzai!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:33.00,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,What? She overworked herself into such a high fever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.36,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,that she's regressed to infancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.64,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:41.02,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Mother, how does one repair a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.63,Default,Sakurako,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, you should probably give \Nher some medicine and let her rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:53.20,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now that you've taken your \Nmedicine, it's time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:56.62,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I don't wanna! I'm not sleepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:59.08,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I wanna stay up and talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:05.48,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Naked story time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.81,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Momma! Do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:12.08,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Of course I do. More than anyone in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:13.19,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:15.77,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Akane loves you too.{orig: Same goes for you.}{alt: I love you too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:16.64,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:20.04,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Why are my boobies so big all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:23.44,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Yours are huge too, Momma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.26,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,You can touch them if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:26.61,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Really?{alt: For reals?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:29.87,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Wow, they're so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:31.86,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Why stop at touching?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:34.87,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,You can suck on them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:36.69,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:38.71,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna drink Momma's milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:40.25,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm not a baby anymore! I'm a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:43.02,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm a... I'm a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:44.23,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.14,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.24,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:51.99,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I caught a cold, so I've been with Momma all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:52.89,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:55.15,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just me and Momma...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:01:59.53,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:04.07,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:06.27,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:11.49,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}It sounds like your mother \Nwas a very kind woman, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.91,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,She must have doted on you for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:17.73,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,and she clearly loved you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:22.20,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I could never take the place of a mother like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:24.31,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nah, she wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:30.06,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,My mom would've just told me to sleep it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:32.30,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,She wasn't the caregiving type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.04,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:38.55,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm glad you were here for me, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:40.41,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.06,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,So, Nadeshiko,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:49.07,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,about the whole master registration thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:56.48,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm still conflicted about treating you like an object,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:03:00.58,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\q2}but I promise I'll find a way \Nto go through with it someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:06.08,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\q2}So if you can just be patient \Nwith me until then, I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.50,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:18.10,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'll just have to keep honing my sex skills \Nuntil that day comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:18.97,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:20.71,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,You and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.01,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,we're going to do {\i1}so{\i0} much together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:25.48,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.34,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,need time to think about it.
